\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Positional representation}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{transformer}

\p{A \newvocab{positional representation} of width #{d} assigns a vector
#{P_t\in\mathbb R^d} to each permitted position #{t}. For additive position
encodings, the initial hidden-state row is
##{
H^{(0)}_t=E(x_t)+P_t.
}}

\p{Section 3.5 of \citef{vaswani2017attention} adds position encodings to
token embeddings. The vectors may be fixed or learned.
Other architectures insert relative or rotary position information inside
attention; those variants do not satisfy the displayed additive interface
without an explicit translation.}
